  "stageId": "main_03-01",
  "title": "Meeting",
  "storyCode": "3-1",
  "avgTag": "After Operation",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/en/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_03-01_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "675dd4a76707496805e977127af0d6cf20e033e964448506e46950769d4bfb9e",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第二十三关（后）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "L.G.D. Agent",
      "text": "Madam...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "text": "Speak.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "L.G.D. Agent",
      "text": "Most of Reunion's forces have retreated already.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "Madam Ch'en, we're also done here.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "text": "Tsk...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "text": "About those Reunion suspects that we rounded up a few days ago...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "text": "Have we been able to get any information out of them?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion Suspect",
      "text": "...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "L.G.D. Agent",
      "text": "Does this crossbow look familiar to you?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion Suspect",
      "text": "...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "L.G.D. Agent",
      "text": "You're able to draw it, aren't you?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "L.G.D. Agent",
      "text": "What's the structure of the ammunition? How does it work?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "L.G.D. Agent",
      "text": "What were you doing in the slums?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "L.G.D. Agent",
      "text": "What were you doing in Lungmen?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion Suspect",
      "text": "...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "L.G.D. Agent",
      "text": "...Nothing.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "L.G.D. Agent",
      "text": "They won't say a word.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "L.G.D. Agent",
      "text": "Or perhaps... they just don't know anything.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "L.G.D. Agent",
      "text": "Like the other Reunion members we defeated, they're probably nothing more than obedient puppets.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "text": "...Make them speak.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "text": "Use any methods necessary.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "text": "I want to know about their squads, their leadership, their strategies, where they're from, and what they plan to do...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "text": "Get everything out of them that you can.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "text": "I want everything I can get.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "text": "Report back to me right away, no matter how insignificant it might seem.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "L.G.D. Agent",
      "text": "Roger!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "Has the L.G.D. ever arrested Reunion members before?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "text": "We can't say for sure.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "text": "In the end, it's just speculation.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "text": "Get me in touch with Hoshiguma!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "text": "How's the Special Operations Division faring?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "text": "Are they still being overwhelmed by a single Infected?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "L.G.D. Agent",
      "text": "Reunion seems to have pulled back on their end as well.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "L.G.D. Agent",
      "text": "Inspector Hoshiguma is worried about a possible trap and is trying to rule out all risks...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "text": "Hmph... Just a single person...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "text": "Who the hell do they think they are, coming and going like that?!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "text": "...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "text": "You should already know what your next mission is going to be, Amiya.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "We're going to get Misha back?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "text": "Correct.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "text": "This will be the joint operation.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "text": "The L.G.D. will take the lead, while Rhodes Island will be in charge of recon and the assault.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "text": "Your mission is complete as long as you can stall Reunion's retreat.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "Understood.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Franka",
      "text": "If we're looking for the enemy... won't we also risk being discovered?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Franka",
      "text": "Right now, we also don't have enough support for our recon squad...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Franka",
      "text": "We can't do this on our own.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "We should leave this to the professionals.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "Franka, help me get in touch with Penguin Logistics.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "We're going to need another favor from Exusiai and Texas.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
